A co-op session (host/coop_live.inc) takes every click that starts a run while it is on (the Play Game panel, the
quest list, the high scores' Play a game, the end note's and the statistics' modes, the end screens'): the Host's
picks the co-op run, the Guest's waits for the Host's, and an end screen's tells the Host which run comes next. The
menus start only Survival and the stock quests in co-op. An end screen tells the session once it shows its buttons,
past its name entry: the next run waits for both players'.
